    "notes": "One part: Piano (2 staves) - must NOT be split even though left-hand notes appear on the treble staff (beams cross between the staves) and right-hand notes on the bass staff. Cross-staff notes keep their voice (LH voice 5 / RH voice 1) and carry the staff they are printed on (<staff>). Notated order: segno at m.3, \"To Coda\" after m.8, \"D.S. al Coda\" after m.18, coda from m.19 - do not unroll. \"Ped.\" / \"*\" signs, \"cantabile\", \"cresc.\", \"dim.\", \"rit.\", \"morendo\", tempo text are not notes or lyrics."
